WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.528
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.528 --> 00:00:04.537
This is "Late Night."
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.873
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki said

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.374
in a briefing yesterday

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.542
that there are about 100
American citizens

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:12.044
still in Afghanistan,

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:15.048
though Psaki stressed they're
doing everything in their power

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.550
to move on to the next question.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.219
Pro-Trump protesters gathered
in New Jersey yesterday

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:23.556
as President Biden surveyed
storm damage from Hurricane Ida.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.057
Okay, but Trump is gone,

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:28.894
so what you guys are
is pro storm damage.

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:33.098
After the Taliban announced a
new all-male interim government

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:34.600
in Afghanistan yesterday,

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.769
the State Department
released a statement

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.105
voicing concern
over the lack of women.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:43.276
Um, you know that's kind of
their whole deal, right?

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.444
It's like walking
into a KKK meeting

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.947
and saying, "Wow!

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:51.517
Just white guys? Okay."

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:54.020
Today was Senator
Bernie Sanders' 80th birthday.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.354
Happy birthday, Bernie.

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:56.689
I would have gotten you
something,

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:00.693
but then I would've had to
get it for everybody.

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:04.597
A 21-foot statue of Confederate
general Robert E. Lee

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.432
was taken down today
in Virginia,

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.768
but only because
they finally finished

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:12.404
their 22-foot statue of him.

00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:15.407
A video recently gained
attention on social media

00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:18.043
showing Rudy Giuliani shaving
at a table

00:01:18.043 --> 00:01:19.545
in an airport restaurant.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.047
And it's even worse
than it sounds

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:24.217
because he was shaving
his bikini line.

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:25.885
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.022
That's right.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:31.156
A video showed Rudy Giuliani

00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:33.660
shaving at a restaurant table
in JFK airport.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:38.164
To be fair, he thought
he was at LaGuardia.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.665
We had some discussion.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.501
We caught a little flak, Baze,
from some people here

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.669
who noted that happened
a long time ago.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:46.005
I was like all --
That was last week.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:49.008
But come on, guys.

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.677
I know we're going back in time
a little bit,

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.778
but you're gonna let that happen
on our hiatus

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:55.114
and we're just never gonna
talk about it?

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.449
No.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.452
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:02.455
The host of the children's show
"Blue's Clues," Steve Burns,

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:05.458
released a video yesterday in
honor of its 25th anniversary,

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.926
but this is weird --

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:10.797
just to remind everyone that
Blue would be long dead by now.

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.966
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:18.971
It must be nice to be Ian,
sitting alone in your apartment.

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:21.807
You go say it.

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:25.478
I just write it.
You say it!

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.746
And finally,
customs officials in Texas

00:02:27.746 --> 00:02:31.417
recently fined a man $500 after
he allegedly tried to smuggle

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:34.587
more than 300 pounds of bologna
and ham over the border.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.422
It was a tough day
for the smuggler,

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:40.093
but a career day
for the drug-sniffing dogs.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.095
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

